  "uketuke": "",
  "A techie struggling to step outside his comfort zone. Invaluable for his Chatter-searching abilities.": "",
  "A homeless guy who lives in the sewers. Trades me sketchy stuff from time to time.": "",
  "The manager of Wild Jackson who constantly seems to be worried about the fate of his business.": "",
  "The manager of the Yoshida Batting Center. Has a pretty good swing for someone his age.": "",
  "A baseball product developer. Sells me top-notch baseball equipment for a relatively good price.": "",
  "A foreigner who dresses up like a ninja. Apparently, he trains night and day to master the ninja arts.": "",
  "A regular at Bar Tender. A charismatic woman that gets along with most people.": "",
  "The manager of a popular ramen shop in Kamurocho. The secret to their enduring popularity is their traditionally made soup stock.": "",
  "The owner of Building One. I owe her big-time because I'm always lagging on my rent...": "",
  "The event planner for Wette Kitchen who really seems to value customer feedback.": "",
  "An employee of Café Alps. As one might expect from a veteran barista, he boasts an extensive knowledge of coffee.": "",
  "A masseuse from Sotenbori. Speaks in Osakan dialect.": "",
  "The owner of a classy bar in Kamurocho. Revered by customers for his amicable personality and bartending expertise.": "",
  "Owner of Kanrai, a high-end yakiniku spot. His professional demeanor befits his role as the manager of a classy restaurant.": "",
  "An unemployed slacker who does nothing but drink all day and bother people. His cane-wielding twin brother is a yakuza.": "",
  "The friendly and upbeat owner of Beef Zone.": "",
  "The flashiest member of the Matsugane Family. Despite looking like a washed-up comedian, he's yakuza to the core.": "",
  "A man who feeds stray cats around the city. Unfortunately, the cats don't seem to be very receptive to this.": "",
  "An well-known author whose claim to fame is the \"Edison\" book series. Often found drinking at Shellac.": "",
  "The world champion of drone racing. Has a Japanese girlfriend and speaks fluent Japanese.": "",
  "An exchange student working at Akaushimaru. Started learning Japanese by listening to J-pop.": ""
 },
